From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:45:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XGame and read the title's
 MicrosoftGame.config.

GameConfig reads the configuration once, from InitializeApiImplEx2(): inline or from the path in
the initialization options, or else the first MicrosoftGame.config beside the executable or in a
parent directory. It keeps the title id (hexadecimal), the MSA app id and MSA full trust. A
missing or invalid configuration does not fail initialization; XGameGetXboxTitleId() returns the
error. XLaunchNewGame() and XLaunchRestartOnCrash() remain stubs. The tests use a
MicrosoftGame.config beside the test executable.

Ported from WineGDK (LGPL-2.1-or-later); changes are original work for macrock.

Topic: xgame
